---
layout: base.njk
title: Feedback and bug reports
description: Tell us what you think of Deaftly, or report a bug. We don't ask for your name or email address.
---
<div class="wrap section section--tight prose">
<h1>Feedback and bug reports</h1>
<p class="lede">Tell us what's working, what isn't, or what you'd like Deaftly to do.</p>
<p>We don't ask for your name or email address, so we can't reply to you directly. Please don't include personal details in your message. See <a href="/privacy/">privacy</a> for what we keep and for how long.</p>

<form class="feedback-form" action="/api/feedback" method="post">
<fieldset>
<legend>What's this about?</legend>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="kind" value="feedback" checked> Feedback or an idea</label>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="kind" value="bug"> Something's not working</label>
</fieldset>

<label for="message">Your message</label>
<textarea id="message" name="message" rows="8" maxlength="5000" required aria-describedby="message-hint"></textarea>
<p id="message-hint" class="muted">Up to 5,000 characters. For a bug, say what you did and what happened.</p>

<label for="appVersion">App version (optional)</label>
<input id="appVersion" name="appVersion" type="text" inputmode="decimal" pattern="\d+\.\d+\.\d+" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="version-hint">
<p id="version-hint" class="muted">Three numbers, like 0.41.1. It's in your phone's Settings, under Apps, then Deaftly.</p>

<div class="trap" aria-hidden="true">
<label for="website">Leave this empty</label>
<input id="website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
</div>

<button class="button" type="submit">Send</button>
</form>
</div>
